msgid "This is %s. We're not taking visitors right now."
msgstr "%s imnida. Jigeum bangmungaeg-eul badji anhseubnida."
msgid "Welcome to %s. The archives are available for public access."
msgstr "%s-e osin geos-eul hwanyeonghamnida. Gilog yeollam ganeunghamnida."
msgid "This is the %s police station. State your business."
msgstr "%s gyeongchalseo imnida. Yong-gon-eul malhaejuseyo."
msgid "City Records Office. How can we help?"
msgstr "Si gilogso. Dowadeurilkkayo?"
msgid "This is a private residence. What do you want?"
msgstr "Gaein jutaeg imnida. Mwol wonhasimnikka?"
msgid "Welcome to %s. This area is restricted."
msgstr "%s-e osyeossseubnida. Jehangu-yeog imnida."
msgid "%s. Come in and browse."
msgstr "%s. Deureo-osyeo dulleoboseyo."
msgid "Welcome to %s! What'll it be?"
msgstr "%s-e osyeossseubnida! Mwol deusilkkayo?"
msgid "Welcome to %s. How can we help you today?"
msgstr "%s-e osyeossseubnida. Eotteohge dowadeurilkkayo?"
msgid "%s. You shouldn't be here."
msgstr "%s. Yeogi isseumyeon an doebnida."
msgid "You leave the building."
msgstr "Geonmul-eul tteonamnida."
msgid "Welcome to %s! What can I do for you?"
msgstr "%s-e osyeossseubnida! Mwol dowadeurilkkayo?"
msgid "Goodbye!"
msgstr "Annyeonghi gaseyo!"
msgid "Buy/Sell"
msgstr "Maemae"
msgid "Any news?"
msgstr "Sosig isseoyo?"
msgid "Leave"
msgstr "Tteonagi"
msgid "You leave."
msgstr "Tteonamnida."
msgid "Trade"
msgstr "Georae"
msgid "Ask around"
msgstr "Dulleobogi"
msgid "Take a look at what I have."
msgstr "Je mulggeon-eul boseyo."
msgid "I might have heard something. Check back later."
msgstr "Mwolga deureossseubnida. Najung-e dasi oseyo."
msgid "Failed to initialize renderer"
msgstr "Rendeoleo chogi-hwa silpae"
msgid "Missing game data"
msgstr "Geim deiteo eobseum"
msgid "No game data found. Please set the data path in Settings or use --data on the command line."
msgstr "Geim deiteo-reul chaj-ji mothaessseubnida. Seoljeong-eseo deiteo gyeongno-reul jijeong haseyo."
msgid "You can also change the data path in Settings."
msgstr "Seoljeong-eseo deiteo gyeongno-reul byeongyeonghal su issseubnida."
msgid "Missing Liberation data"
msgstr "Liberation deiteo eobseum"
